sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If a parallelepipedal solid is cut by a plane through the diagonals of the opposite planes, then the solid is bisected by the plane.
----
proof:

Let the parallelepipedal solid *AB* be cut by the plane {CDEF|planeCDEF} through the diagonals {CF} and {DE} of opposite planes.

